{"id":"int-e84107cdcde9cd6db177f7dd40904749","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-11-23T23:28:39.07129551Z","actor":"Yogthos","issue_id":"jds-s7a.6","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Decided (see README 'Wire protocol'): Datastar's SSE framing, event names and data-line keys unchanged; elements and signals values are data decoded by an app-supplied codec {:content-type :encode :decode}, EDN by default, JSON possible without the library parsing JSON. Signals are JSON-compatible EDN (keyword keys; nil/bool/number/string/vector/map values); elements are EDN. Selectors #id or none; all 8 modes; Datastar retry defaults. Requests: datastar-request: true, signals encoded by the codec (query param for GET, body otherwise), Content-Type and Accept name the codec's type — no custom header."}}
